              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p>In 2019 Roadlab assisted HHO Consulting Engineers in improving the container stacking efficiency of Transnet’s Cape Town Port Terminal.</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1690,
                    "udi": "umb://media/73bf5796526c4675856bf2ca98ba6565",
                    "image": "/media/sbll421m/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h44m17s392.png"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p>Data received would enable benchmarking of stiffness’s of the various layers to include in a pavement loading analysis to derive pavement-strengthening options for improved container stacking efficiency.</p>\n<p>Our testing and sampling of concrete pavement slabs within the port terminals formed part of a multi-phase, multi-billion Rand upgrade to a facility that is pivotal to the regional economy.</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
